body='''The fixed bagged-anchor experiment has completed its scientific work and verification. Both primary preliminary and exact-source no-prior-cache suites passed **1501 tests** (431 current-study). Development reused all33 saved models (18 bagged,15 references), reused21 derived scores and calculated66 new ones, with zero new full development fits. Independent auditing reconstructed120 physical scores,222 forward operating rows,947 matched contrasts and every diagnostic before selection.

The selected **bagged_anchor_balanced_logit_a25 / pooled** scores macro development F2 **0.330880962**, versus the previous strongest **0.330793254**: a tiny +0.000087708 difference. Its frozen26 roles used11 unique bases/27 scores on consumed month7, with six new bagged fits,five reference reuses and zero additive/tree reproductions. Consumed F2 is **0.372240**, recall **49.58%**, precision **18.64%** and workload **3.92%**. It trails tree fusion **0.372694** and unweighted **0.376884**, so the five-reference improvement criterion fails and the broader goal remains active. See [findings](reports/baf-bagged-anchor-fusion-v1/findings.md), [matched effects](reports/baf-bagged-anchor-fusion-v1/matched_effect_summary.csv) and [execution verification](reports/baf-bagged-anchor-fusion-v1/execution_verification.json).

All1500 paired draws and75 development/25 consumed intervals were independently reconstructed. The figure's111 operating points,twelve matched curves,canonical endpoints and legends passed value and pixel-identical regeneration checks. Thirty cumulative current-study tiny fits (18 prior checkpoint,6 primary preliminary,6 clean-copy) are separate from historical-module tests and the six full-size transfer fits. The accepted execution receipt comes from the clean copy at the identical source/config/software identity; its ledger records six current-study plus69 historical-module fits. Earlier fixtures,retries and the supplementary27-versus28 score-count assertion correction are retained without changing scientific sources.

The55-source/config/software/protocol/selection/access identities are frozen. Actual-host predictor-only preflight passed for903157 rows/157 maximum features and an11,130,259,216-byte workspace bound on this32-GiB host. Preserved nine-fit sampling and eight-fit ancestry evidence passed,including present optional files,with zero new production miniature fits. Sixteen exact selection restores/rejection,the Base checksum,Python3.12.9 and27 pins passed in the disposable copy with no prior model/prediction caches. This is no claim of full-size production retraining there. Preserve all sixteen completed predecessors,separate Newton identities,735 mandatory paths,3732 historical files and the stopped attempt. Original implementation-status.md remains a3/14 historical checkpoint; see the later verified outputs for current status. Final closure/synchronization/archive is pending. F2 beta=2 has no quota or precision floor; settings are analyst-selected and month7 remains consumed.

'''
# Plain spacing for prose without changing any frozen scientific source.
body=re.sub(r'\b[A-Za-z]{3,}(?=\d)', lambda m:m.group()+' ',body);body=re.sub(r'(?<=\d)(?=[A-Za-z])',' ',body);body=re.sub(r',(?=[A-Za-z]|\d{1,2}\b)',', ',body).replace("'s111","'s 111")
p=Path('README.md');text=p.read_text();start=text.index('The isolated [configuration](configs/bagged-anchor-fusion.json)');end=text.index('For reproduction use Python 3.12.9',start)
text=text[:start]+body+text[end:]
