The original implementation-status.md and implementation-checks/ preserve the 3/14 checkpoint and earlier source/test identities. Eighteen current-study tiny format fits occurred through that checkpoint. The later primary preliminary full suite passed1501 tests and made six current-study plus69 historical-module fits. It predates the test-only optional-cache assertion correction; its exact sources and receipts remain preserved. The exact-source fresh-copy suite also passed1501 tests with six current-study plus69 historical fits. Its complete receipt is the accepted execution receipt in the primary run. Cumulative current-study tiny fits are30. Focused125 gate checks and nine lifecycle checks made zero fits.

