Actual-host predictor-only resource and preserved nine/eight-fit source ancestry passed with zero new production miniature fits. Development used18 bagged/15 reference reuses,21 derived reuses and66 new calculations with zero full fits. Independent audit reconstructed all33 saved models,120 scores,222 operating rows,947 contrasts and diagnostics before freeze. Selection froze26 roles,11 bases and27 scores before further consumed-month access. The supplementary first check incorrectly assumed the across-case maximum28 scores; it failed before writing verification and was corrected to compare the actual prospective winner case27. Scientific sources/settings/freeze were unchanged.

Bounded transfer used six new full bagged fits,five reference reuses,three derived reuses and13 calculations. Independent reporting checked all33 development and11 final saved models,1500 paired draws and100 interval summaries. The selected development gain is tiny; two consumed reference comparisons fail. No winner replacement or hindsight cutoff was made. All predecessor identities and the stopped attempt remain intact. Final closure records verify closed logs,figures,source identities,OpenSpec and hashes; the broader goal remains active.
''')
